  "lyrics": {
    "rawText": "\nI missed the mark by just a beat  \nStill landed somewhere on my feet  \nThe answer wasn’t what I planned  \nBut fit the question better than\n\nEvery loop returns misread  \nA clearer truth inside instead  \nNot broken, just a shade askew  \nEnough to show another view\n\nOff by one, still true  \nThe math holds even when it moves  \nWhat looks wrong from far away  \nLocks in close enough to stay\n\nPerfection stalls, it wants control  \nNear-miss keeps the system whole  \nEvery flaw that doesn’t fail  \nIs a signal, not a tale\n\nIf it lined up flawlessly  \nThere’d be nothing left to see  \nThe offset keeps the pulse alive  \nGives the reason room to drive\n\nOff by one, still true  \nThe math holds even when it moves  \nWhat looks wrong from far away  \nLocks in close enough to stay\n\nClose enough\n"
  },
